- Python 3.12, uv-managed. FastAPI app in src/codereviewer; layout is fixed — never create new top-level packages
- All config via the Settings singleton in config.py; never read os.environ elsewhere; never hardcode secrets
- All LLM prompt strings live in agent/prompts.py only
- All LLM calls use structured output via pydantic models — never hand-parse JSON from raw text
- Type hints everywhere; pydantic models for all external data shapes
- Pure logic (diff_engine, severity gate) stays pure: no I/O, no LLM calls, fully unit-tested
- No new dependencies without listing them explicitly at the top of your response
- Do not modify modules other than the one named in my prompt
